   "text": "Flavius Claudius Iulianus - Wikisource, the free online library\n\nJump to content\n\nFrom Wikisource\n\n←\n\nAuthor Index: Iu\n\nFlavius Claudius Iulianus\n(331–363)\n\n→\n\nsister projects : Wikipedia article , Commons gallery , Commons category , quotes , Wikidata item\n\nRoman emperor; known as Julian the Apostate\n\nFlavius Claudius Iulianus\n\n130626 Q33941 Flavius Claudius Iulianus Flavius Claudius Iulianus Iulianus Roman emperor; known as Julian the Apostate\n\nWorks\n\n[ edit ]\n\nOrations:\nPanegyric in honour of Constantius\n\nThe heroic deeds of Constantius\n\nPanegyric in honour of Eusebia\n\nHymn to King Helios\n\nHymn to the mother of the gods\n\nTo the uneducated Cynics\n\nTo the Cynic Heracleios\n\nConsolation upon the departure of Sallust\n\nLetter to Themistius the philosopher\n\nLetter to the senate and people of Athens\n\nFragment of a letter to a priest\n\nSatires:\nThe Caesars\n\nMisopogon\n\nLetters\n\nThe Shorter Fragments\n\nEpigrams\n\nAgainst the Galileans\n\nWorks about Iulianus\n\n[ edit ]\n\nLibanius, letter 33 (358)\n\nLibanius, letter 224 (362)\n\nLibanius, letter 372 (358)\n\nLibanius, letter 525\n\nLibanius, letter 586\n\nLibanius, letter 591\n\nLibanius, letter 602\n\nLibanius, letter 622 (363)\n\nLibanius, letter 670 (362)\n\nLibanius, letter 712 (361)\n\nLibanius, letter 1035\n\nLibanius, letter 1125 (358)\n\nLibanius, letter 1392\n\nLibanius, letter 3 (363)\n\nLibanius, letter 14\n\nSome or all works by this author were published before January 1, 1931, and are in the public domain worldwide because the author died at least 100 years ago. Translations or editions published later may be copyrighted. Posthumous works may be copyrighted based on how long they have been published in certain countries and areas.\n\nPublic domain Public domain false false\n\nAuthority control\nVIAF :&#160; 57406701\n\nLC Auth :&#160; n79067875\n\nFAST :&#160; 37874\n\nISNI :&#160; 0000 0001 2134 5428\n\nGND :&#160; 118558684\n\nSELIBR :&#